  bench-record                 Record harnessz baselines for sampler-backed microbenchmarks (use -Doptimize=ReleaseFast)
  bench-gate                   Gate sampler-backed microbenchmarks against recorded baselines (use -Doptimize=ReleaseFast)
  verify-evidence              Audit docs/evidence source hashes (report-only unless --strict)
  bench-grpc-cpp               Compare shared gRPC with official grpc-cpp TCP ping-pong workloads
  bench-http1-hyper            Compare zio-backed HTTP/1 pipeline and body workloads with Hyper
  bench-http2-cancel-hyper     Compare HTTP/2 cancellation recovery against Hyper
  interop-http3-public         Verify public HTTP/3 endpoints with system trust
  bench-websocket-slices-ab    Compare caller-joined and direct-slice WebSocket sends over H1/H2/H3
  bench-websocket-mostly-idle  Compare mostly-idle WebSocket memory with pinned websocket.zig

