      sha1, tree               20-byte cryptographic hash (ELF, WASM)
      md5                      16-byte cryptographic hash (ELF)
      uuid                     16-byte random UUID (ELF, WASM)
      0x[hexstring]            Constant ID, maximum 32 bytes (ELF, WASM)
      none                     (default) No build ID
